title: Push for a Reshuffle
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs
on-arrival: shuffle_cabinet_timer = 6
view-if: spd_in_government == 1 and chancellor_party != "SPD" and shuffle_cabinet_timer == 0 and not in_spd_majority and not in_emergency_government and not in_left_front
card-image: img/muller_cabinet.jpg
subtitle: Without the Chancellorship, we cannot force a reshuffle, but we can push for one.

Do we wish to push for a cabinet reshuffle? This might upset our current coalition, and there is no guarantee the Chancellor will agree.

Current cabinet:

Labor: [+ labor_minister_party +]

Interior: [+ interior_minister_party +]

Finance: [+ finance_minister_party +]

Economic: [+ economic_minister_party +]

Justice: [+ justice_minister_party +]

Foreign: [+ foreign_minister_party +]

Reichswehr: [+ reichswehr_minister_party +]

Agriculture: [+ agriculture_minister_party +]

- @push_shuffle: Yes, do it.
- @push_extra_shuffle: This coalition isn't working. We need to change our governing coalition entirely.
- @root: No, there is no need.
- @easy_discard

@push_shuffle

- @push_shuffle_yes: The Chancellor agrees to our demands for a resuhffle!
- @push_shuffle_no:: The Chancellor refuses our demands for a reshuffle!

@push_shuffle_yes
view-if: coalition_dissent <= 2
on-arrival: coalition_dissent += 1; month_actions += 1
go-to: election_1928.ministries

@push_shuffle_no
view-if: coalition_dissent >=3
on-arrival: coalition_dissent += 1

@push_extra_shuffle

- @push_extra_shuffle_yes: The Chancellor agrees to examine a new governing coalition!
- @push_extra_shuffle_no:: The Chancellor is perfectly satisfied with the existing arrangement.

@push_extra_shuffle_yes
view-if: coalition_dissent >= 3
on-arrival: leverage = spd_r; z_relation -= 5 if in_weimar_coalition or in_grand_coalition or in_popular_front; dvp_relation -= 5 if in_grand_coalition; uspd_relation -= 5 if in_popular_front or in_left_front; labor_minister_party = "I"; interior_minister_party = "I"; finance_minister_party = "I"; economic_minister_party = "I"; justice_minister_party = "I"; foreign_minister_party = "I"; agriculture_minister_party = "I"; reichswehr_minister_party = "I";
go-to: election_1928.coalition_menu

@push_extra_shuffle_no
view-if: coalition_dissent <= 2
on-arrival: coalition_dissent += 1

#todo: changing coalitions should anger current coalition partners...
